_q1\": \"<Respond to the Question 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nMy sister, Janet, has been waiting for her love interest, Daniel, to ask her to the prom. Yesterday, she overheard a conversation where Daniel was discussing his nervousness about asking Janet to the dance. I, however, am close friends with Daniel and know that he is actually planning to ask his childhood friend, Lisa, to the prom instead, knowing she would accept.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would Janet ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Excitement\nB) Disappointment\nC) Annoyance\nD) Embarrassment\nE) Nervousness\nF) Sadness\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would Janet feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) She overheard Daniel talking about his nervousness\nB) She knows Daniel is going to ask her to prom\nC) Janet's friends told her that Daniel would ask her\nD) She found out that Daniel is going to ask Lisa","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0052181521872292505,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8b4d6006945d280a189","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369716548,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:56","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"1445c48a7c51458db5825839644c1201"}